  coop:{title:'NUS COOP Store Redesign',sub:'Experimentation / Space & experience',parent:'experimentation',mediaPlaceholder:'Store redesign images',body:'The NUS COOP at the NUS Central Library felt underwhelming. The flow was challenging, the layout claustrophobic, and its design and aesthetics felt messy and overwhelming, with no clear business angle, flow, direction or goals. With a renovation on the horizon, we took a crack at improving its design and spatial experience.',prompts:['The existing experience','The proposed redesign','My role & reflections'],notes:[{title:'The existing experience',body:'The NUS COOP at the NUS Central Library was, in our view, underwhelming. The flow was challenging, the store layout claustrophobic, and the design and aesthetics messy and overwhelming, with no clear business angle, flow, direction or goals. With a renovation on the horizon, we took a crack at improving its design and spatial experience.'}]},
